      "h2": "Making the most of a weekend break",
      "html": "<ul><li><strong>City hotels can be cheaper at weekends</strong>, when business travellers go home.</li>\n<li><strong>Countryside and seaside hotels often cost more at weekends</strong>, so try Sunday–Tuesday for a bargain.</li>\n<li><strong>Ask about late checkout.</strong> It makes a Sunday far more relaxed, and some sites include it on member rates.</li></ul>"
    }
